{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（3日）上午9時27分，深水埗元州街218至224號地下一間膠袋舖發生火警。消防員到場時火警已熄滅，無人受傷毋須疏散，起因有待調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場路面一度封閉。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194230412378116096573290.jpeg/Ob0oZfgh-BGyixwfyP23a4vylssDSGZEPFhyOTxYcjk\"/><figcaption>現場路面一度封閉。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場調查火警起因。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194230409618132992305127.jpeg/Nrqt7zENSbjoLyo-JgLKsACMeqMer84vm_dV75v3Ve8\"/><figcaption>消防員在場調查火警起因。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場調查火警起因。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194230406681989120176083.jpeg/EEmj9Jf4voG-rRcZ7zpspvaS6GK6m7jdYqtYt2KrWLc\"/><figcaption>消防員在場調查火警起因。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:22:02.009590+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:10:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:19:18.118030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:11.388561+00:00","content_hash":"f968db6beae20b933ee1339c28dcdfb6e651135d237ed1a77381b373db285b46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}